@startuml
title Strict compatibility：Academic Paper Reviewer 外层 work graph
skinparam shadowing false
actor User
participant "Host Agent" as Agent
participant "ResearchSpec CLI" as CLI
participant "academic-paper-reviewer\n7-agent team" as Reviewer
database "Workspace" as Files

Agent -> CLI : status + route instructions
CLI --> Agent : one of 6 routes, registered manuscript,
CLI --> Agent : output DAG and Gate policy
Agent -> User : route and read-only boundary
User --> Agent : confirm route
Agent -> CLI : Start
CLI -> Files : receipt then subflow state

loop each declared review artifact
  Agent -> CLI : scoped work instructions
  CLI --> Agent : manuscript/evidence reads + output path
  Agent -> Reviewer : perform bounded review
  note over Reviewer
    Internal full route:
    field analysis -> independent five-person panel
    -> editorial synthesis and roadmap.
    Panel parallelism is semantic, not CLI work parallelism.
  end note
  Reviewer -> Files : separate review candidate
  note right of Files : Manuscript is never rewritten.
  Agent -> CLI : hash-bound Submit
  CLI -> Files : submit receipt + registry
end

opt required route Gate
  Agent -> User : Verify review-quality verdict
  User --> Agent : confirm Gate
  Agent -> CLI : submit Gate
  CLI -> Files : Gate receipt + ledger
end
Agent -> CLI : Advance transition:<instance>/<completion-node>
CLI -> Files : transition receipt + state
@enduml
